{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9452bd84-222f-8bec-b684-ced07e2e2dbf",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T09:19:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Um, I need a certified copy of a birth certificate. It's for a passport. I don't know if I'm calling the right place, is this okay? Is this the right office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is the right place if the person was born in Newport. Was that the case?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, born here, at the hospital. Me. It's mine. So I need the, the certified one, not just a regular copy. The passport people said certified. Is that different? Is a photocopy okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A photocopy won't work. It has to be the certified copy with the raised seal. There's an application form for it, and you'd bring it in with your photo ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. A form. Do I fill it out here or at home? I saw something online but it said a few things, I wasn't sure which one was mine. Is it okay if I print it at home and bring it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can print it and fill it out at home. Just bring it with your ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the ID, does it have to be a license? Because mine, I think it's fine, it's not expired. Well, it's okay, right? Not expired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A valid driver's license is fine. If it's current, you're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So what are the hours to drop it off? I just want to drop the form. When can I come by, is it okay to come in the morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open Monday through Friday, eight-thirty to four-thirty. Morning is fine. Come to the clerk's counter at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight-thirty to four-thirty. Okay. Today's Friday, so I could even come today? Or is it too late, is it okay today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today's fine, we're open until four-thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. You know, I almost didn't call. Our old neighbor, Mr. Costa, he knew everybody on the block by name, he'd have known who to ask. Now I'm just guessing. Sorry, I'm rambling. So the form, print it, ID, come in. That's all? Nothing else I need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If anything's missing, we'll tell you at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Thank you very much. I'll try to come this afternoon. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T09:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Bye now."
    }
  ],
